title: "UniSkills: universal, evidence-driven Agent Skills for engineering work"
abstract: >-
  A portable suite of Agent Skills that encode repeatable engineering procedures with explicit evidence
  labels, risk-based depth profiles, context and tool economy rules, and deterministic validation.
